# operation_postcondition_check — operation postcondition assertion
# (README §7). Tests verifying operation postconditions.

OperationPostconditionCheck is project
OperationPostconditionCheck module examplesOperationPostconditionCheck
OperationPostconditionCheck target console
OperationPostconditionCheck entry main

examplesOperationPostconditionCheck is module
examplesOperationPostconditionCheck path examples.operationPostconditionCheck
examplesOperationPostconditionCheck exports main
examplesOperationPostconditionCheck purpose "Demonstrate operation postcondition"
examplesOperationPostconditionCheck invariant "Postconditions are enforced"

ExitCode is alias
ExitCode for Int32

stdoutWriter is capability
stdoutWriter grants write console.stdout

main is operation
main out ExitCode
main effect write console.stdout
main uses stdoutWriter
main memory heap no
main async no
main purpose "Check operation postcondition"
main invariant "Postcondition holds after operation"

main let result immutable Int64 99
main let okCode immutable ExitCode 0

main do printResult
main return okCode

printResult is call
printResult in main
printResult invokes console.writeIntegerLine
printResult arg value Int64 result
